  "invariants": [
    "Noether Core builds and validates without Lovelace Laboratory",
    "volatile storage and no network are the defaults",
    "persistent storage and Internet access require separate explicit selections",
    "defensive untrusted-system-code execution requires KVM, an outer bubblewrap namespace, and the QEMU sandbox and fails closed without any required layer",
    "defensive untrusted-system-code execution has no network, persistence, host shares, or host device passthrough",
    "defensive untrusted-system-code execution treats the workload as attacker-controlled guest root and relies on no guest-local UID boundary",
    "optional hostile payload ingress requires an explicit source and exact SHA-256 and is limited to bounded guest-read-only secondary media without host execution, a host source share, guest networking, or persistence",
    "TCG is functional-only and never establishes the untrusted-code isolation claim",
    "NOXFRAME remains metadata-only unless its guest broker is explicitly enabled",
    "NOXFRAME guest execution never becomes ambient host command execution",
    "Ghidra headless operation is an analysis target and not a containment boundary",
    "Internet evidence is limited to one exact artifact-bound HTTPS response over the fixed QEMU user-NAT topology",
    "all containment claims name the exact exercised layers and residual limitations",
    "missing capability evidence remains NOT_MEASURED and grants no claim"
  ],
  "disqualifying_conditions": [
    "selected as the default WuciOS profile",
    "used as release-authoritative evidence",
    "presented as Noether Core",
    "persistent storage selected implicitly",
    "network access selected implicitly",
    "hostile mode launched through TCG or without KVM, the required outer bubblewrap namespace, or the QEMU sandbox",
    "hostile mode receives a network device, persistent disk, host share, or host device",
    "hostile payload ingress is accepted without its source digest, outside offline volatile KVM hostile mode, through writable media or a host source share, or with host execution",
    "NOXFRAME executes an ambient host command",
    "Ghidra availability is described as containment",
    "Internet reachability is claimed without the exact topology, boot line, successful listener probe, exact sidecar response, and independently revalidated full console transcript",
    "hostile isolation claimed while its artifact-bound evidence gate is NOT_MEASURED",
    "payload-ingress runtime validation is claimed without manifest.validation.hostile_payload_ingress and its exact artifact-bound evidence gate",
    "perfect isolation, escape-proof operation, or safe malware execution is claimed"
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Programming and analysis packages intentionally enlarge this profile's trusted computing base.",
    "The defensive untrusted-system-code cell is a layered risk-reduction boundary, not a proof that guest escape is impossible.",
    "The hostile guest intentionally permits guest-root administration; unprivileged QEMU refers only to the host-side QEMU process.",
    "Read-only hostile payload ingress narrows data-transfer authority but does not make the sample, guest, hypervisor, or host safe.",
    "A profile contract does not demonstrate that its runtime targets have been built or exercised.",
    "The installed bubblewrap package is not evidence that the required outer host namespace was entered.",
    "The ordinary hostile-kvm-cell evidence does not exercise payload ingress and cannot promote manifest.validation.hostile_payload_ingress; payload-ingress evidence cannot promote manifest.validation.hostile_kvm_cell.",
    "The Internet probe supports only an artifact-bound single-endpoint reachability observation and does not establish network isolation, anonymity, containment, availability, release authority, or arbitrary-malware safety.",
    "required_evidence_outputs is the exact canonical output set; missing hostile-cell and payload-ingress records keep their separate manifest validation fields NOT_MEASURED and leave the corresponding capabilities unclaimed."
  ],
